{
    "title": "ACE Scanner - PDF Scanner App",
    "description": "ACE Scanner is a <b>free</b> PDF scanner app!\r\n\r\nThis simple scanner app uses your mobile device camera to quickly scan documents.\r\n\r\nYou can use it to scan, import, and convert documents and images, and share as PDF/JPG <b>with just one click</b>!\r\n\r\n<b>WHY CHOOSE ACE Scanner:</b>\r\n1. Quickly Scan Any Documents to PDFs\r\nWith just one single tap, ACE Scanner - document scanner can quickly scan and convert all kinds of documents - <b>receipts, notes, documents, invoices, photos, business cards, certificates, whiteboards, etc.</b> You can print out the scan results right away via Cloud Print with Doc Scanner.\r\n\r\n2. Powerful PDF Reader & PDF Manager\r\n\u2714\ufe0fAuto scan all your PDF files and display in a clear list\r\n\u2714\ufe0fQuickly open and read PDFs\r\n\u2714\ufe0fEasily manage PDFs: copy, rename, draw, sort by date or name, etc.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fChoose search categories (Folders, Docs, etc.) to quickly find what you need\r\n\r\n3. High Quality Scanning Results\r\nDocuments processed by this PDF scanner are sharp, clear, and high-resolution, thanks to the precise edges detection, <b>smart cropping</b>, and <b>auto-enhancement</b> features. This scanner app also provides multiple filters - Docs, Image, Enhance, Black & White, etc. - to further optimize the scanning results.\r\n\r\n4. One-Click Sharing\r\nYou can easily share scanned files <b>in PDF or JPEG formats</b> with your friends via email, messaging apps, or post the documents on social media.\r\n\r\n5. More Than Doc Scanner: Practical Documents Editing\r\n\u2714\ufe0fAdd/edit/delete any pages individually in the document\r\n\u2714\ufe0fConvenient document layout adjustment\r\n\u2714\ufe0fMultiple PDF page sizes (Letter, Legal, A4, etc.) to meet all needs\r\n\r\n6. Add E-Signatures\r\nNeed to sign your signature on PDFs? ACE Scanner - Doc Scanner supports adding <b>electronic signatures</b> to scanned documents. Easily generate and send documents with your e-signature on your mobile device!\r\n\r\n7. Custom Security Watermarks\r\nYou can quickly create custom anti-counterfeiting watermarks to protect your files. Adjust the text/size/transparency/color of the watermark as you prefer.\r\n\r\n8. OCR Text Recognition\r\nACE Scanner - scanner app adopts OCR (Optical Character Recognition) technology to help you accurately <b>recognize text</b> on images or papers, and <b>export text</b> for later copying, editing, searching, and sharing.\r\n\r\n9. Quick Search\r\nHard to find the target file among a bunch of files? Simply enter one keyword, the <b>quick search feature</b> of PDF Scanner will find the file you need among multiple folders. Besides, you can also <b>find texts in images and notes</b> in no time with the OCR search feature.\r\n\r\nNow download ACE Scanner - a simple and <b>FREE PDF scanner</b>! Say goodbye to bulky file cabinets and enjoy a more productive life.\r\n\r\nUPCOMING FEATURES:\r\n\ud83d\udc49Add Annotations\r\nIn the future versions, users can add annotations to the scanning results with the advanced editing feature. You can tag and review documents more effectively on your mobile device!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49Lock Confidential Documents\r\nLock your confidential documents <b>with passwords</b> and share them securely. No one can open it without a password.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49File Backup and Sync\r\nACE Scanner - document scanner allows users to <b>backup and sync</b> files to Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, Evernote, etc. You can view, edit, and manage your files by simply logging in to your account on your smartphone, tablet, computer or any devices.\r\n\r\n<b>You can use ACE Scanner - document scanner to:</b>\r\n\u2714\ufe0fScan Business Card, Receipt, Invoice, and more for office use.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fScan PPT, Note, Book, and more to improve learning efficiency.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fScan ID Card, Passport, Driver License, and other important certificates.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fScan more: Tax Roll, Memo, Map, Paint, Travel Brochure, Manuscript...\r\n\r\nPERMISSION REQUIRED:\r\n* For users of Android 11 and above, All Files Access permission is required to access, manage, and edit all PDF files on your device.",
    "descriptionHTML": "ACE Scanner is a <b>free</b> PDF scanner app!<br><br>This simple scanner app uses your mobile device camera to quickly scan documents.<br><br>You can use it to scan, import, and convert documents and images, and share as PDF/JPG <b>with just one click</b>!<br><br><b>WHY CHOOSE ACE Scanner:</b><br>1. Quickly Scan Any Documents to PDFs<br>With just one single tap, ACE Scanner - document scanner can quickly scan and convert all kinds of documents - <b>receipts, notes, documents, invoices, photos, business cards, certificates, whiteboards, etc.</b> You can print out the scan results right away via Cloud Print with Doc Scanner.<br><br>2. Powerful PDF Reader &amp; PDF Manager<br>\u2714\ufe0fAuto scan all your PDF files and display in a clear list<br>\u2714\ufe0fQuickly open and read PDFs<br>\u2714\ufe0fEasily manage PDFs: copy, rename, draw, sort by date or name, etc.<br>\u2714\ufe0fChoose search categories (Folders, Docs, etc.) to quickly find what you need<br><br>3. High Quality Scanning Results<br>Documents processed by this PDF scanner are sharp, clear, and high-resolution, thanks to the precise edges detection, <b>smart cropping</b>, and <b>auto-enhancement</b> features. This scanner app also provides multiple filters - Docs, Image, Enhance, Black &amp; White, etc. - to further optimize the scanning results.<br><br>4. One-Click Sharing<br>You can easily share scanned files <b>in PDF or JPEG formats</b> with your friends via email, messaging apps, or post the documents on social media.<br><br>5. More Than Doc Scanner: Practical Documents Editing<br>\u2714\ufe0fAdd/edit/delete any pages individually in the document<br>\u2714\ufe0fConvenient document layout adjustment<br>\u2714\ufe0fMultiple PDF page sizes (Letter, Legal, A4, etc.) to meet all needs<br><br>6. Add E-Signatures<br>Need to sign your signature on PDFs? ACE Scanner - Doc Scanner supports adding <b>electronic signatures</b> to scanned documents. Easily generate and send documents with your e-signature on your mobile device!<br><br>7. Custom Security Watermarks<br>You can quickly create custom anti-counterfeiting watermarks to protect your files. Adjust the text/size/transparency/color of the watermark as you prefer.<br><br>8. OCR Text Recognition<br>ACE Scanner - scanner app adopts OCR (Optical Character Recognition) technology to help you accurately <b>recognize text</b> on images or papers, and <b>export text</b> for later copying, editing, searching, and sharing.<br><br>9. Quick Search<br>Hard to find the target file among a bunch of files? Simply enter one keyword, the <b>quick search feature</b> of PDF Scanner will find the file you need among multiple folders. Besides, you can also <b>find texts in images and notes</b> in no time with the OCR search feature.<br><br>Now download ACE Scanner - a simple and <b>FREE PDF scanner</b>! Say goodbye to bulky file cabinets and enjoy a more productive life.<br><br>UPCOMING FEATURES:<br>\ud83d\udc49Add Annotations<br>In the future versions, users can add annotations to the scanning results with the advanced editing feature. You can tag and review documents more effectively on your mobile device!<br><br>\ud83d\udc49Lock Confidential Documents<br>Lock your confidential documents <b>with passwords</b> and share them securely. No one can open it without a password.<br><br>\ud83d\udc49File Backup and Sync<br>ACE Scanner - document scanner allows users to <b>backup and sync</b> files to Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, Evernote, etc. You can view, edit, and manage your files by simply logging in to your account on your smartphone, tablet, computer or any devices.<br><br><b>You can use ACE Scanner - document scanner to:</b><br>\u2714\ufe0fScan Business Card, Receipt, Invoice, and more for office use.<br>\u2714\ufe0fScan PPT, Note, Book, and more to improve learning efficiency.<br>\u2714\ufe0fScan ID Card, Passport, Driver License, and other important certificates.<br>\u2714\ufe0fScan more: Tax Roll, Memo, Map, Paint, Travel Brochure, Manuscript...<br><br>PERMISSION REQUIRED:<br>* For users of Android 11 and above, All Files Access permission is required to access, manage, and edit all PDF files on your device.",
